"""HSBB3072 - 30 V 100 A N-channel MOSFET, PRPAK3x3-8L. Bare part.

Datasheet: HUASHUO HSBB3072, Ver 3.0.

Pins (page 1, "PRPAK3*3 Pin Configuration"): package pins 1-3 source, 4 gate, 5-8 and the
exposed tab drain. Footprint pad numbers: 1 = gate (one pad); 2 = source (three pads);
3 = drain (four leads, the 2.6 x 2.0 mm exposed pad and the two side tabs).

Absolute maximum ratings (page 1): VDS 30 V; VGS +-20 V; ID 100 A at TC = 25 C (65 A at
100 C); IDM 240 A; PD 42 W at TC = 25 C; TJ and TSTG -55 to 150 C. Thermal (page 1): RthJA
70 C/W max on 1 in2 of 2 oz FR-4; RthJC 3 C/W max.

Electrical characteristics (page 2, TJ = 25 C): RDS(on) 2.0 / 2.4 mOhm at VGS = 10 V,
2.9 / 3.8 mOhm at VGS = 4.5 V (ID = 20 A); VGS(th) 1.0 / 1.7 / 2.3 V; IDSS 1 uA max at
VDS = 24 V; IGSS +-100 nA at VGS = +-20 V; Qg 26 nC at 4.5 V; Ciss 2860 pF, Coss 1300 pF,
Crss 229 pF at VDS = 15 V; td(on) 11 ns, tr 46 ns at RG = 3.3 Ohm; body diode VSD 1.2 V max
at IS = 1 A.

A board must keep |VGS| <= 20 V and VDS <= 30 V including transients.
"""

G = io(Net)
D = io(Net)
S = io(Net)

# The exposed pad's stencil (TI SLUA271C 4.4: 50-70 % paste coverage on an exposed pad, in windows
# that let it outgas): "whole", one aperture as drawn; "split", windows round the thermal-via sites
# drawn on Cmts.User (0.2 mm), for vias left open in the pad.
Paste = enum("whole", "split")
paste = config(
    Paste, default="whole", help="the exposed drain pad's paste: one aperture, or windows round the thermal vias"
)
FOOTPRINT = {
    "whole": "PRPAK-8_L3.0-W3.0-P0.65-BL-EP.kicad_mod",
    "split": "PRPAK-8_L3.0-W3.0-P0.65-BL-EP_SplitPaste.kicad_mod",
}

Component(
    name="HSBB3072",
    prefix="Q",
    symbol=Symbol(library="HSBB3072.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File(FOOTPRINT[paste.value]),
    part=Part(mpn="HSBB3072", manufacturer="HUASHUO"),
    pins={
        "G": G,
        "S": S,
        "D": D,
    },
)
